%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d3139b830089d814fbd239d3511709d3, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Messages:
  - message: Before everyone had perished, your people deduced Moonlight can fight
      off the fog.
    uniqueWordsToColour: []
    wordColour: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  - message: 'However, the Moon Statue has lost all but one fragment. With one fragment
      left, only a small amount of Moonlight can illuminate your surroundings and
      protect you from the miasmic air. '
    uniqueWordsToColour: []
    wordColour: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  - message: 'You must restore the Moon Statue and make it whole again. Do so, and
      The Moon Goddess will revive you and Moonlight will banish the fog far enough
      for you to rescue others. '
    uniqueWordsToColour: []
    wordColour: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  - message: "Three fragments are missing from the Moon Statue. Each of these fragments
      are spread across the foggy forest, and you have to find them. It won\u2019t
      be an easy task though. "
    uniqueWordsToColour:
    - Three fragments
    wordColour: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  - message: 'Upon praying to the Moon Statue for protection, an Ancient Prayer would
      be recited, but you forgot the words to it. The Ancient Prayer was broken into
      three parts, and to get a Moon fragment back, you need to know a Verse of The
      Ancient Prayer. '
    uniqueWordsToColour:
    - three parts
    wordColour: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  - message: "I\u2019d suggest looking around in the forest for souls and listening
      to them. They can give you clues to recount the Ancient Prayer. "
    uniqueWordsToColour:
    - souls
    - clues
    wordColour: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  - message: You have three Moon Fragments to find and three Ancient Prayer Verses
      to reforge together, friend.
    uniqueWordsToColour:
    - three Moon Fragments
    - 'three Ancient Prayer Verses '
    wordColour: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  - message: You have a set time to explore the forest before the miasma becomes
      too much to handle. To progress to the next day, interact with the Moon Statue.
    uniqueWordsToColour:
    - set time
    - next day
    - Moon Statue
    wordColour: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  - message: "Plan accordingly to navigate through the toxic fog strategically. That,
      and don\u2019t forget your Crafting skills. Your Crafting Bench will be your
      best friend here. "
    uniqueWordsToColour:
    - Crafting Bench
    wordColour: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  - message: Confused about Controls? Open Pause Menu (ESC) and Click (?) Button!
    uniqueWordsToColour: []
    wordColour: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
